│ for patients treated with preoperative radiation combined with endocavitary hyperthermia."}, {"study_index": 6,      │
│ "title": "[Use of combined treatment of rectal cancer involving metastases to regional lymph nodes]", "abstract":    │
│ "Use of combined pre- and intraoperative radiotherapy for rectal cancer involving metastases to regional lymph nodes │
